# Build context hygiene for the combined image (see ./Dockerfile).
# The image rebuilds the frontend and the Python venv from source, so anything
# derived, local, or stateful is excluded to keep the context small and to
# avoid baking dev state / secrets into layers.

.git
.github
docs
sandbox
**/*.md

# Python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

# Node / frontend build output (rebuilt in-image)
**/node_modules
frontend/dist

# Local runtime state — NEVER bake these. config.yaml + skills/ ARE kept
# (they hold only env-var-name references, no secret values).
backend/data/*.db
backend/data/*.db-*
backend/data/*.bak*
backend/data/skill-uploads
**/*.log
.env
**/.env
